# Consultancy Pro – Cursor Rules

Yeh project **Consultancy Pro** (Q Engineering) hai — BIS licensing / consultancy ops.
Stack **Qirlpl_Lims_Railway** jaisi hai (Vite + React + Railway GoTrue/PostgREST/Storage + Resend).

## AI Behavior
- Seedha files edit karo; chat me long code blocks mat dump karo.
- Multi-file changes ek saath apply karo.
- Pehle codebase search, phir edit.

## Project Structure
- `frontend/` – React + Vite + TypeScript (LIMS stone/amber theme)
- `backend/supabase/migrations/` – Railway Postgres SQL
- `railway-stack/gateway/` – Caddy API gateway
- `railway-stack/functions/` – Node functions (users + Resend email)
- `pdf-service/` – Playwright PDF

## Rules
- Hosted Supabase Cloud / Vercel mat use karo.
- Theme/UI: existing `limsThemeUi` + MasterPage patterns reuse karo.
- App English; explanations Hindi/Hinglish OK.
- Domain: BIS ops, clients, IS codes, finance, email.
